      "message": "We didn\u0027t see this problem maybe because we\u0027ve never used HAS_TASK_*_RW/RO in the source code? RW and RO are compiled separately. So, I think HAS_TASK_* should be enough for conditional compilation. What is HAS_TASK_*_RW/RO for, then?",
